.TH GIT-CHRONOS-DESKTOP 1 "October 2026" "Git Chronos 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
git-chronos-desktop \- open the Git Chronos desktop client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B git-chronos-desktop
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Git Chronos
is a free, open-source, local-first desktop client for working with Git
repositories.
.PP
The application can also be launched as Git Chronos from the desktop
application menu.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/org.gitchronos.desktop
Per-user application state and preferences, when present.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Git Chronos contributors.
